2. creating reducer inside a featurefolder 
3. import createSlice and then create a initialState it can have array as well as object
4. we create initial slice whihc have name initial state then reducer .
5. in reducer we write declare the function and write the logic here in the reducer
6. state will tell you about the current state of the initial state


